  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "So, what's going on, Wolf?",
          "rhyme": "Olf",
          "persona_id": "persona_dr_tc"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Talk to me, man",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_dr_tc"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "People worry, we hearing stories about you getting into fights and all this unnecessary bullshit",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_dr_tc"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "It's—Wh—What's on your mind? Talk to me, I'm here",
          "rhyme": "eR",
          "persona_id": "persona_dr_tc"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCD",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCD"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Domo, roll another one",
          "rhyme": "On",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I'm just fuckin' with you, I ain't smoking none",
          "rhyme": "On",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "My squad bring terror, no intended pun (Wolf Gang, nigga)",
          "rhyme": "un",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Merch booth made niggas extensive funds (This nigga paid)",
          "rhyme": "wndz",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Mama got the Rover with the Range (Yeah)",
          "rhyme": "#Z",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "She don't ever, ever gotta struggle, not again (Wolf Gang, nigga)",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "And I put that on my dead grandmama's name (Rest in peace)",
          "rhyme": "am",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Too soon (Yeah)",
          "rhyme": "un",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AABCDEFB",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AABCDEFB"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Uh, my nigga Slater, yeah, that's my little pony",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Little homies is repping like I been fucking with Kony",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Nigga, Phillip and Kobi, to my niggas that know me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Your boy seem happy as fuck, but truthfully, your boy lonely",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Nigga's a target for marketing, he's an artist",
          "rhyme": "ist",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Can't even walk into Target without bothering customers",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Bothering, asking me for a picture, can I talk to they sister?",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Nah, nigga, get lost, you're fucking smothering",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "God, I wanna quit, but I can't",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "'Cause mother and sister can't pay the rent",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Four stories with storage, I'm twenty-one with a mortgage",
          "rhyme": "aZ",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "And touring's paying the bills, life is paying for thrills",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Life's a bitch, bruh, but from the third floor, man, she's gorgeous",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "A year ago, I was broke; now, how can I afford this?",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "I started off with disposables; now, I have an assortment",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "And I'm using these negatives to develop a portrait",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Now, the frame is a pain in the ass",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "To get it in without a scratch or stain on the glass, but that's not important",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Just as long as it's printed, and I hinted it is",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "But when I get it, I'll make sure you get a copy, you bitch",
          "rhyme": "itS",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Shit, I'll even add a signature with the fuckin' pic-a-ture",
          "rhyme": "yR",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "I'll even tell you the film I used, and the aperture",
          "rhyme": "yR",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AABACDEFGDHIJAGKLGKMNN",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AABAACDAECFAGAECFECAHH"
    },
