    {
      "section_id": "section_4",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Uh, Grandmother died, didn't cry, not a tear",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Not gonna lie, fucking weird, no water dripped out the eye",
          "rhyme": "Ej",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "But when I got the news, yup, it left your boy stuck",
          "rhyme": "yk",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "'Cause when my mom dipped, she was the one that gave me a fuck",
          "rhyme": "yk",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Mom calling and calling, I'm on my way to a show",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I answered, she crying, saying, \"Sadie is dying\"",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "The doc said she only had a week for us to speak",
          "rhyme": "Ek",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Before she deceased, 'cause cancer was just eating her cheeks up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Fuck! Nah, this is really awkward for me, bruh",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "I hang the phone up, and adjust my seat back",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "And started to think, like, \"What the fuck just happened?\"",
          "rhyme": "Ed",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "I never had a death, and I just seen her a week ago",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Meet them at the hospital, I should",
          "rhyme": "Old",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "In between the set of BADBADNOTGOOD",
          "rhyme": "ud",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Lionel asked what happened, I said it's bad, bad, not good",
          "rhyme": "ud",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Just take me to the Cedars-Sinai off of Oakwood",
          "rhyme": "ud",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Getting there, family sitting center chair",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Awkward in the lobby, it was floating in the thinning air",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Getting there, need a sticker saying how I got in there, there’s her room",
          "rhyme": "um",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Open up the curtain, she's just sitting there, \"Hello\"",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Our conversation's brief",
          "rhyme": "Ef",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Couldn't even make eye contact when we speak",
          "rhyme": "Ek",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Lookin' at her, you could tell all she had was weak",
          "rhyme": "Ek",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "And I'm not talkin' days, bruh, I'm talkin' 'bout her strife",
          "rhyme": "ajf",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "I sat there, twenty minutes tops",
          "rhyme": "Op",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Hoping it was just a fucking plea that she could cop",
          "rhyme": "Op",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "She died that night",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCCDEFGHIJDKLLLAAMDNFFOPPQ",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AABBCDAEFGACHFFFAAFCAAAGHHG"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_5",
      "type": "outro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Oh, that's heavy, man",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_dr_tc"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I'm sorry for your loss",
          "rhyme": "Os",
          "persona_id": "persona_dr_tc"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Yeah, whatever",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Don't worry about it...",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "The last time I seen Samuel, he was lookin' for you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_dr_tc"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Fuck that nigga, Samuel!",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Uhh, have you seen him?",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "persona_dr_tc"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Nah, but if I seen that nigga, I woulda killed him",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        }
      ],
